e="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Provider disputes connected to commerce, customer, and marketing context—with uncertainty shown explicitly.</p></div><div className="flex items-center gap-2"><Link href="/dashboard/chargebacks/exposure" className="rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold">Exposure</Link><div className="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500">{s?`${s.liveTotal} Live · ${s.historicalTotal} Historical`:"Loading…"}</div></div></header>\n  <div className="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><Metric name="Total disputes" value={String(s?.total??"—")} note="Live + historical"/><Metric name="Needs response" value={String(s?.statuses?.needs_response||0)}/><Metric name="Under review" value={String(s?.statuses?.under_review||0)}/><Metric name="Won / Lost" value={`${s?.statuses?.won||0} / ${s?.statuses?.lost||0}`}/></div>\n  <div className="rounded-xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 p-3 text-xs text-sky-900">Dispute principal and provider-reported fees are shown per dispute. TraceKit does not present these as actual wallet loss or recovered dollars without authoritative wallet movements.</div>\n  {error&&<div className="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-4 text-sm text-red-800">{error}</div>}\n  <section className="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white"><div className="border-b p-5"><h2 className="font-semibold">Dispute portfolio</h2><p className="text-xs text-slate-500">{data?`${data.pagination.returned} shown`:"Loading…"}</p></div><div className="overflow-x-auto"><table className="min-w-[850px] w-full text-left text-sm"><thead className="bg-slate-50 text-[10px] uppercase text-slate-500"><tr>{["Dispute","Status","Principal / fee","Reason","Match authority","Order"].map(h=><th key={h} className="px-4 py-3">{h}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody className="divide-y">{data?.rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id} onClick={()=>setSelected(r)} className="cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-50"><td className="px-4 py-3"><div>{date(r.disputeDate)}</div><div className="text-[10px] text-slate-400">{r.sourceLabel}</div></td><td className="px-4 py-3">{label(r.status)}</td><td className="px-4 py-3">{formatDisputeAmount(r.amount,r.currency,r.currencySource)}<div className="text-xs text-slate-500">Fee {formatDisputeAmount(r.fee,r.feeCurrency,r.feeCurrencySource)}</div></td><td className="px-4 py-3">{r.reason||"—"}</td><td className="px-4 py-3"><span className={`rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold ${tone(r.matchAuthority)}`}>{MATCH_AUTHORITY_LABELS[r.matchAuthority]}</span></td><td className="px-4 py-3 text-xs">{r.matchedOrderId?"Related order":"No order relationship"}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><div className="flex justify-between border-t p-4"><button disabled={page<=1} onClick={()=>setPage(p=>p-1)} className="rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-xs disabled:opacity-40">Previous</button><span className="text-xs">Page {page}</span><button disabled={!data?.pagination.hasMore} onClick={()=>setPage(p=>p+1)} className="rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-xs disabled:opacity-40">Next</button></div></section>\n  {selected&&<aside role="dialog" aria-label="Dispute detail" className="fixed inset-y-0 right-0 z-40 w-full max-w-2xl overflow-y-auto border-l bg-white p-6 shadow-2xl"><div className="flex justify-between"><div><div className="text-xs uppercase text-slate-500">{selected.sourceLabel}</div><h2 className="text-xl font-semibold">Dispute detail</h2></div><button onClick={()=>setSelected(null)} className="rounded-sm border px-3 py-1 text-xs">Close</button></div>\n   {selected.source==="live"&&<p className="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">Provider buyer reference not shown. Provider identifiers are not verified customer identities.</p>}<div className="mt-5 flex gap-2"><span className={`rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold ${tone(detail?.matchAuthority||selected.matchAuthority)}`}>{MATCH_AUTHORITY_LABELS[detail?.matchAuthority||selected.matchAuthority]} relationship</span><span className="rounded-full border px-2 py-1 text-xs">{label(selected.status)}</span></div>\n   <div className="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm"><div><div className="text-xs text-slate-500">Provider dispute ID</div><div className="break-all font-medium">{detail?.dispute?.provider_dispute_id||detail?.dispute?.source_row_identity||"Unavailable"}</div></div><div><div className="text-xs text-slate-500">Observed</div>{date(selected.disputeDate)}</div><div><div className="text-xs text-slate-500">Dispute principal</div>{formatDisputeAmount(selected.amount,detail ? detail.currency : selected.currency,detail ? detail.currencySource : selected.currencySource)}</div><div><div className="text-xs text-slate-500">Provider-reported fee</div>{formatDisputeAmount(selected.fee,detail ? detail.feeCurrency : selected.feeCurrency,detail ? detail.feeCurrencySource : selected.feeCurrencySource)}</div></div>\n   <section className="mt-5 rounded-xl border p-4"><h3 className="font-semibold">Lifecycle</h3>{detail?.lifecycle?.length?<div className="mt-3 space-y-2">{detail.lifecycle.map((e,i)=><div key={e.id||i} className="text-sm"><b>{label(e.status||e.state||e.event_type)}</b><div className="text-xs text-slate-500">{date(e.observed_at)} · {label(e.event_type)}</div></div>)}</div>:<p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Lifecycle history is not available for this historical import.</p>}</section>\n   {detail?.attributionStatus?<section className={`mt-4 rounded-xl border p-4 text-sm ${detail.attributionStatus.state==="attributable"?"border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-950":detail.attributionStatus.state==="attribution_pending"?"border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-950":detail.attributionStatus.state.startsWith("ambiguous")?"border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 text-violet-950":"border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800"}`}><div className="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] opacity-70">Marketing attribution state</div><div className="mt-1 font-semibold">{detail.attributionStatus.label}</div><p className="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 opacity-80">{de'... 5831 more characters,
